		{"id":"c7219fa9cf5a9381","x":2640,"y":1775,"width":317,"height":178,"type":"text","text":"Recherche dans le vault\n\n- Sentence-transformers existants\n- Notes pertinentes au contexte\n- Cartographie des lacunes\n- Zones peu denses = frontière\n"},
